Description: avcodec/vaapi: encode stereo frame packing through packed SEI
 .
 Adapt Mark Thompson's 2019 VA-API proposal to current CBS and the shared
 encoder frame packing helper. Enable frame_packing in the existing sei
 flags, validate the layout, and fail visibly when packed SEI is unavailable.
 Clear HEVC non-packed constraints only when initial decoded side data
 establishes that a mark will be written. Reject late HEVC metadata that
 would contradict the already emitted parameter sets.
 .
 AMD VA-API proof covers every supported packing and eye order, independent
 NAL and trace_headers read-back, FFmpeg/mpv decoding, B-frame temporal
 identity, invalid tiled geometry and late-layout refusals. Plain 2D and
 explicitly disabled streams are byte-identical to the unpatched encoder.
 .
 Adapted-from: https://ffmpeg.org/pipermail/ffmpeg-devel/2019-October/250966.html
 Co-authored-by: Mark Thompson
 .
